{"quarantine_id": "quarantine:sha256:4b2d7fc55250d995ce6f865ff28d251630ed000ca47b888c5b60e011e8859238", "candidate": {"document_id": "sha256:322bcc0f61b25922bff1168145792c3ecdc3f428d3824ddefc6ba90aa9251fa7", "pointer": "/BC8/lakewood-expansion/approved-capital", "locator": {"page": 2, "section": "EXPANSION OF LAKEWOOD"}}, "reason_code": "SINGLE_SCOPE_TOTAL_CANNOT_BOUND_THE_PROGRAMME", "reason": "the A$20m Lakewood expansion budget is not adopted as the company or growth-programme amount. It covers one scope of three; Coyote and Mt Clement are pre-FID with no published total; BC8 incurred A$131.2m of growth capital in FY26 without publishing scope totals for it, so a A$20m ceiling would understate execution capital in the favourable direction. The 30 July 2026 quarterly also makes the expansion's timing conditional on the Fingals and Majestic ramp-up and states the growth strategy is under review, so no Gate 2 coverage period is established.", "decision_source": "coordinated research pass, 23 August 2026", "producing_tool": "tools/kb.py register-claim", "related_claim": "claim:sha256:4af56322e9154e0fc5e12b478939ae49151743bdccfebbcd8bcc61e8801a13dc", "created_at": "2026-08-23T18:54:04+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-08-23T18:54:04+00:00"}
{"quarantine_id": "quarantine:sha256:aedb07a5eb83cf0db0096b139ea0c672865d0c2b8e3d54ae89fad5f7e02b9ec4", "candidate": {"document_id": "sha256:314fa0a9bb1f1704e5a54e9e8cb78b85cdb8ccd2d10351bb23704ad77dec2391", "pointer": "/BGL/fy27-non-sustaining/itemised-guidance", "locator": {"page": 7, "section": "FY27 Guidance"}}, "reason_code": "PARTIAL_ENUMERATION_CANNOT_TOTAL_A_SCOPE", "reason": "the FY27 non-sustaining items are introduced with 'includes', so the enumeration is expressly partial and summing them would understate the company's remaining execution capital in the favourable direction. FY28 non-sustaining capital is not guided at all, so the one-year guidance cannot become a completion total for the FY27 programme scope either.", "decision_source": "coordinated research pass, 23 August 2026", "producing_tool": "tools/kb.py register-claim", "related_claim": "claim:sha256:41ed203aa80f487b27409601874c5bcfb69f80e1aae3f2bdec68a9b86d55bcfc", "created_at": "2026-08-23T18:54:04+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-08-23T18:54:04+00:00"}
{"quarantine_id": "quarantine:sha256:63c1ca7149c3412f8a7fbcc12015a818e68feca42cb00ebe64187c3136af969b", "candidate": {"document_id": "sha256:4970a5f228cb3ec2cf5621bd53a0d65317a8aedcd80154adef6f338956d721d9", "pointer": "/WGX/cue-hub-expansion/indicative-capital", "locator": {"page": 11, "section": "CXP Capital Costs — Table 4"}}, "reason_code": "SCOPING_STUDY_ESTIMATE_NOT_APPROVED_SCOPE", "reason": "the Cue Hub expansion capital is a scoping-study-level estimate that the issuer itself describes as study level, with no final investment decision announced. A pre-FID study estimate is not an approved finite scope and is not admissible as committed or remaining execution capital.", "decision_source": "coordinated research pass, 23 August 2026", "producing_tool": "tools/kb.py register-claim", "related_claim": "claim:sha256:7aaccbb39738e833e7075ad933b7a85541c03ee1bbf3ddf8bff3e9e3bb92d12d", "created_at": "2026-08-23T18:54:04+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-08-23T18:54:04+00:00"}
{"quarantine_id": "quarantine:sha256:693a62dd786333bde9499c2c4751d98e252080b56ddbb54d823e2800575746ec", "candidate": {"document_id": "sha256:bb47b95631fe0c8c2dad6838b7b6e389aca412137fe62a2f07ef159c7afdd2c7", "pointer": "/WGX/higginsville-expansion-plan/approved-capital", "locator": {"page": 6, "section": "Expansion Capital Costs — Table 2"}}, "reason_code": "APPROVED_SCOPE_UNDER_REVIEW_NOT_A_HORIZON_AMOUNT", "reason": "the 10 March 2026 approved Higginsville capital is not adopted as a company or Gate 2 horizon amount: the 18 August 2026 Fletcher Ore Reserve release states the timing and scope of the previously approved 2.6 Mtpa stage are under review while a larger 4 Mtpa case is advanced, that case is uncosted, and the release says the approach may extend the period Higginsville operates at 1.6 Mtpa. The amount therefore bounds nothing in either direction.", "decision_source": "coordinated research pass, 23 August 2026", "producing_tool": "tools/kb.py register-claim", "related_claim": "claim:sha256:c35b59326a13d78bef2b6230408f0187b4588ca3c9b5e3f3f30c4c5fc0683e79", "created_at": "2026-08-23T18:54:04+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-08-23T18:54:04+00:00"}
